(a post; thence S 5 deg W 4509 feet to a stone; thence N 85 deg W 3523 feet to a marked oak;) Tj
T*
(thence N 5 deg E 4157 feet to the place of beginning, containing 640.00 acres, more or less,) Tj
T*
(in Ritchie County, West Virginia \(the "Ranch"\).) Tj
